<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reporting Tool</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme-c.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/teacher-nav') %>
  <main class="container stack reporting-tool-menu-page">
    <div class="calendar-header-row report-header-row">
      <div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 6 · Consolidated</span><h2>Reporting Tool</h2><p class="muted">Generate reliable operational, student, class, and leadership reports from one place.</p></div>
    </div>

    <section class="reporting-command-overview" aria-label="Current reporting overview">
      <article class="card"><strong><%= overview.availableReports %></strong><span>Available reports</span></article>
      <article class="card"><strong><%= overview.criticalIntegrityIssues %></strong><span>Critical integrity issues</span></article>
      <article class="card"><strong><%= overview.teachersNeedingAction %></strong><span>Teachers needing weekly action</span></article>
      <article class="card"><strong><%= overview.recognitionCoverage %>%</strong><span>28-day recognition coverage</span></article>
      <article class="card"><strong><%= overview.schoolConsistency %>%</strong><span>Current term consistency</span></article>
      <article class="card"><strong><%= overview.pushEnabledUsers %></strong><span>Push-enabled users</span></article>
    </section>

    <section class="card reporting-guide">
      <div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Quick guide</span><h3>Choose the right report</h3><p class="muted">Use the narrowest report that answers the question; open the transaction ledger only when individual transaction evidence is required.</p></div>
      <div class="reporting-guide-grid">
        <div><strong>Is the data reliable?</strong><a href="/teacher/reporting-tool/data-integrity">Data Integrity</a></div>
        <div><strong>What needs action now?</strong><a href="/teacher/reporting-tool/weekly-action">Weekly Action</a></div>
        <div><strong>Who may be overlooked?</strong><a href="/teacher/reporting-tool/recognition-coverage">Recognition Coverage</a></div>
        <div><strong>What happened to one student?</strong><a href="/teacher/reporting-tool/student-statement">Student Statement</a></div>
        <div><strong>How is one class doing?</strong><a href="/teacher/reporting-tool/class-digest">Class Digest</a></div>
        <div><strong>What should leadership review?</strong><a href="/teacher/reporting-tool/leadership-summary">Leadership Summary</a></div>
      </div>
      <small class="muted">Snapshot generated <%= overview.generatedAt %>.</small>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <div class="report-section-heading"><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Reliability</span><h3>Data Integrity and Administration</h3><p class="muted">Check data quality before relying on totals, rankings, or exports.</p></div>
      <div class="reporting-tool-menu-grid">
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card">
          <div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 1 · Available</span><h3>PITIS Data Integrity Report</h3><p class="muted">Reconcile leaderboard and ledger totals; identify duplicates, timestamp collisions, class differences, future dates, unusual values, missing references, and snapshot inconsistencies.</p></div>
          <a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/data-integrity">Run Integrity Report</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <div class="report-section-heading"><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Students and classes</span><h3>Detailed Records</h3><p class="muted">Transaction evidence and calculated balances are grouped here as complementary views.</p></div>
      <div class="reporting-tool-menu-grid">
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Transaction ledger</span><h3>PITIS Transaction Report</h3><p class="muted">Detailed awards and deductions by class, date, reason, and awarding teacher.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/teacher/report">Open Transaction Report</a></article>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Calculated balances</span><h3>Student PITIS Totals</h3><p class="muted">Collected PITIS, deductions, net balance, and transaction count by student.</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="/teacher/report/student-totals">Open Totals Report</a></article>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 3 · Available</span><h3>Student Recognition Coverage</h3><p class="muted">Students with limited or no recognition, class coverage, award distribution, common reasons, and weekly comparisons.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/recognition-coverage">Run Coverage Report</a></article>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 4 · Available</span><h3>Individual Student Statement</h3><p class="muted">Printable student ledger with opening and closing balances, awards, deductions, reasons, teachers, and period summaries.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/student-statement">Create Student Statement</a></article>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 4 · Available</span><h3>Class Weekly Digest</h3><p class="muted">Recognition coverage, daily activity, common reasons, teacher participation, deductions, and students not yet recognised.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/class-digest">Create Class Digest</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <div class="report-section-heading"><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Action and leadership</span><h3>Monitoring and Improvement</h3><p class="muted">Turn PITIS activity into weekly action and school-improvement evidence.</p></div>
      <div class="reporting-tool-menu-grid">
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Current dashboard</span><h3>SIP PITIS Dashboard</h3><p class="muted">Teacher consistency targets, weekly trends, teacher matrix, term progress, exclusions, raw audit, CSV, and print output.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/sip-pitis" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open SIP Dashboard</a></article>
        <% if (currentUser && currentUser.role === 'admin') { %><article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card admin-target-settings-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Admin settings</span><h3>School PITIS Targets</h3><p class="muted">Set the number of teachers expected to meet the consistency target for each school term and manage which accounts are measured.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/sip-pitis/settings">Set Term Targets</a></article><% } %>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 2 · Available</span><h3>Weekly PITIS Action Report</h3><p class="muted">Teachers needing support, remaining target days, inactive classes, unrecognised students, and unusual activity requiring follow-up.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/weekly-action">Run Weekly Action Report</a></article>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 5 · Available</span><h3>Leadership Term Summary</h3><p class="muted">One-page SIP status, teacher consistency, recognition coverage, class comparisons, trends, and support priorities.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/leadership-summary">Open Leadership Summary</a></article>
        <article class="card reporting-tool-menu-card featured-report-card"><div><span class="reporting-tool-menu-kicker">Phase 5 · Available</span><h3>PWA and Notification Adoption</h3><p class="muted">P.I.T.I.S invitations, push-enabled devices, measured app usage, QR scans, and PWA award activity.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/teacher/reporting-tool/pwa-adoption">Open Adoption Report</a></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script src="/js/inactivity.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
